        "id": 116048,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-24T04:50:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Devastating Aurora's incap does not count as a Incap for winning.</p><p>Sentinel Tactics is more of a team based game. While all characters are balanced, some of ways of countering other characters. Take 2 versus 2 and the match will be much more balanced.</p>",
