      {
        "id": 116049,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-24T04:54:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Incaps through that power don't count for 'scenario bonuses', it says so on the card. I would count a point scored in a skirmish as a scenario bonus.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And one on one skirmishes are the worst, you really want more people/heroes to get a feel for the 'tactical' aspect of Sentinel Tactics.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:23.220Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
