        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Incaps through that power don&#39;t count for &#39;scenario bonuses&#39;, it says so on the card. I would count a point scored in a skirmish as a scenario bonus.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And one on one skirmishes are the worst, you really want more people/heroes to get a feel for the &#39;tactical&#39; aspect of Sentinel Tactics.</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
