      {
        "id": 116050,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-24T16:22:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dawn is one of the strongest characters in the game, and 1v1 she is really tough. &nbsp;Ra isn't a great 1v1 character, because while he can outdamage anyone, he is far too easy to incap. &nbsp;Legacy + Ra is a crazy team, since Legacy can protect Ra.</p><p>There are characters that are really well suited to defeating specific other characters, and it balances out a lot more in team fights.</p><p>Also while Skirmishes are cool, the straight up fight to incaps style is great for learning the game, but not much more. &nbsp;Which is why we've been working on other skirmish types.</p><p>The game really comes into its own when you get to teams of 3. &nbsp;That is my favorite team size, not so big that rounds take forever, but there is so much more flexibility in team comp.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:23.305Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
