        "raw": "<p>Dawn is one of the strongest characters in the game, and 1v1 she is really tough. &nbsp;Ra isn&#39;t a great 1v1 character, because while he can outdamage anyone, he is far too easy to incap. &nbsp;Legacy + Ra is a crazy team, since Legacy can protect Ra.</p><p>There are characters that are really well suited to defeating specific other characters, and it balances out a lot more in team fights.</p><p>Also while Skirmishes are cool, the straight up fight to incaps style is great for learning the game, but not much more. &nbsp;Which is why we&#39;ve been working on other skirmish types.</p><p>The game really comes into its own when you get to teams of 3. &nbsp;That is my favorite team size, not so big that rounds take forever, but there is so much more flexibility in team comp.</p>",
