        "created_at": "2014-08-24T17:07:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've collected Phantaskippy's and kitmehsu's alternate skirmish modes&nbsp;<span>(king of the mountain, capture the flag, tag-team, etc.) <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/tactics\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here on my site</a> if you'd like to give them a try. &nbsp;You might find them more interesting than just having a couple of characters run at each other and punch each other until someone falls down.</span></p>",
